1
00:00:00,135 --> 00:00:03,605
(Bernadette:)Tough crowd.

2
00:00:03,605 --> 00:00:05,105
(Howard:)I'm sorry.

3
00:00:05,106 --> 00:00:06,976
(Raj:)This is very sweet. Thanks.

4
00:00:06,975 --> 00:00:08,105
(Howard:)So, how you doing?

5
00:00:08,109 --> 00:00:09,279
(Raj:)Better. I guess

6
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,607
(Raj:)the news just hit me
a lot harder than I expected.

7
00:00:11,613 --> 00:00:13,113
(Bernadette:)Well, of course.

8
00:00:13,114 --> 00:00:15,444
(Bernadette:)I would be devastated
if my parents split up.

9
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:18,950
(Howard:)Why? Your father barely
speaks to your mother.

10
00:00:18,953 --> 00:00:20,183
(Bernadette:)Well, at least
he stuck around,

11
00:00:20,188 --> 00:00:22,118
(Bernadette:)not like your dad,
who just took off.

12
00:00:22,123 --> 00:00:25,193
(Howard:)As you can see, we're
here to cheer you up.

13
00:00:26,461 --> 00:00:27,961
(Bernadette:)Sorry, Raj.

14
00:00:27,962 --> 00:00:29,962
(Bernadette:)Do you have any sense of
what happened with your folks?

15
00:00:29,964 --> 00:00:33,834
(Raj:)I think, over time, they started
to resent each other,

16
00:00:33,835 --> 00:00:35,205
(Raj:)and instead of talking
about the things

17
00:00:35,203 --> 00:00:37,133
(Raj:)that bothered them,
they kept it bottled up,

18
00:00:37,138 --> 00:00:39,208
(Raj:)and the hate just grew.

19
00:00:39,207 --> 00:00:41,977
(Bernadette:)It's a shame they spent
all that time unhappy.

20
00:00:41,976 --> 00:00:43,976
(Bernadette:)But sometimes,

21
00:00:43,978 --> 00:00:46,448
there's muffin
you can do about it.

22
00:00:48,483 --> 00:00:50,753
(Bernadette:)You get it, right?

23
00:00:54,656 --> 00:00:56,886
(Penny:)Oh, it's nice
you got him that.

24
00:00:56,891 --> 00:00:58,561
(Sheldon:)Oh, this isn't
for Leonard, no.

25
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)Amy bought it for me.

